{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration","roleHeading":"Class","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"ScanbotSDK"}],"externalID":"c:@M@ScanbotSDK@objc(cs)SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration","symbolKind":"class","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/detectionRate","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/energySaveDetectionRate","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/inactivityTimeout","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/isEnergySavingEnabled","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/motionSensitivity"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/defaultConfiguration"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The energy management configuration object for a ‘SBSDKBaseScannerViewController’ and its subclasses."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"‘SBSDKBaseScannerViewController’ and subclasses sport a customizable energy management system."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Since scanners running on a live video feed can put a lot of load onto the CPU and\/or GPU","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"of the device, causing the battery to drain quickly and running the device hot, you can customize the energy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"consumption using this class by configuring the rate of detections\/recognitions per second in performance mode as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"well as in energy saving mode.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In performance mode the scanners will be fed with a higher, configurable rate of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"video frames per second."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"After a certain, configurable period of inactivity the energy save mode will be engaged and the rate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of scans will be reduced to a lower (configurable) rate."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can also configure the time of inactivity before the automatic mode switches from performance to energy save mode.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Inactivity here means that both of the following conditions are met:"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerenergyconfiguration"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerenergyconfiguration"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objcMembers"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The device did not register significant motion for this period.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No positive scanner results have been registered during this period.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Once in energy save mode the device can only return to performance mode if it is moved significantly or a positive","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"detection\/scanning result was registered."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","identifiers":["doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/objc(cs)NSObject"],"title":"Inherits From","kind":"relationships"},{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/objc(pl)NSObject","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/s7CVarArgP","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/s28CustomDebugStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/SQ","doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/SH"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"references":{"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/SQ":{"title":"Swift.Equatable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/SQ"},"doc://net.doo.ScanbotSDK/documentation/ScanbotSDK/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration/defaultConfiguration":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultConfiguration"}],"url":"\/documentation\/scanbotsdk\/sbsdkbasescannerenergyconfiguration\/defaultconfiguration","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the default configuration with the properties initialized as mentioned in their description."}],"title":"defaultConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/net.doo.ScanbotSDK\/documentation\/ScanbotSDK\/SBSDKBaseScannerEnergyConfiguration\/defaultConfiguration","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultConfiguration"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preci